// Title: Security Support Provider (SSP) Added to LSA Configuration
// Rule ID: eeb30123-9fbd-4ee8-aaa0-2e545bbed6dc
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence, attack.t1547.005
// Category: registry_event
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: azure_monitor
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/registry/registry_event/registry_event_ssp_added_lsa_config.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
